{"packageRef":{"id":"content.c.p05","version":"1.0.0"},"subject":{"id":"exercise.c.two-loop-sums","version":"1.1.0","title":"两种循环求和","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"lessonRef":{"id":"lesson.c.loops","version":"1.1.0"},"learningRevision":1,"acceptedPriorVersions":["1.0.1"],"knowledgeRefs":[{"id":"knowledge.c.loops","version":"1.0.0"}],"programRef":{"id":"program.c.two-loop-sums","version":"1.0.0"},"judgeRef":{"id":"judge.c.two-loop-sums","version":"1.0.0"},"prompt":"输入n为0到30，保留输入源且不重新赋值n。分别用while与for从1累加到n，第一行输出while结果，第二行输出for结果，每行末尾换行。n=0两行均为0；1为1/1；5为15/15；30为465/465。两个循环使用独立累加器，正n时都实际迭代并把累加结果用于对应输出。无关循环配合公式直接输出不满足目标。所有测试正常结束且返回0。思路：初始化、判断、累加、更新；再用另一种循环重新完成一次。","tests":[{"caseKey":"zero","input":{"n":0},"expectedStdout":"0\n0\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"one","input":{"n":1},"expectedStdout":"1\n1\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"normal","input":{"n":5},"expectedStdout":"15\n15\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"maximum","input":{"n":30},"expectedStdout":"465\n465\n","expectedExitCode":0}],"rewardRef":{"id":"reward.exercise.first-pass","version":"1.0.0"}},"program":{"id":"program.c.two-loop-sums","version":"1.0.0","title":"两种循环求和参考","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"subsetRef":{"id":"subset.c.p0","version":"1.0.0"},"inputRef":{"id":"input.c.loop-count","version":"1.0.0"},"exampleInput":{"n":5},"sourceExample":"#include <stdio.h>\nint main(void) {\n    int n = 5;\n    int i = 1;\n    int sumWhile = 0;\n    while (i <= n) {\n        sumWhile = sumWhile + i;\n        i = i + 1;\n    }\n    int sumFor = 0;\n    for (int j = 1; j <= n; j = j + 1) {\n        sumFor = sumFor + j;\n    }\n    printf(\"%d\\n%d\\n\", sumWhile, sumFor);\n    return 0;\n}\n","bindings":[{"bindingKey":"param.n","inputKey":"n","targetName":"n","targetKind":"scalar","from":"field"}],"blockRefs":[{"id":"block.c.main","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.integer","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.declare-int","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.read-variable","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.assign-variable","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.arithmetic","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.comparison","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.while","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.for","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.printf","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.return","version":"1.0.0"}],"reference":{"document":"../架构决策/01.3-正反样例清单.md","locator":"REF-04"}},"inputSpec":{"id":"input.c.loop-count","version":"1.0.0","title":"循环次数n","fields":[{"key":"n","kind":"integer","min":0,"max":30}],"relations":[]},"judgeProfile":{"id":"judge.c.two-loop-sums","version":"1.0.0","title":"双循环累加检查","rule":"while-for-accumulations","targetDescription":"正n时while和for真实迭代，两行输出分别依赖各自循环的累加；n=0两路为0。"}}